00:52:27.150 --> 00:52:29.950
The next time I get the money, I'll bring the three of them here.

00:52:30.160 --> 00:52:34.220
It's a requirement for King Kong.

00:52:34.220 --> 00:52:37.250
If Kong doesn't know three of us, then I'll do it.

00:52:37.250 --> 00:52:39.380
I'm Dr. Who.

