- Get him out. - Are you sure?

00:55:46.100 --> 00:55:47.830
He's being very quiet.

00:56:21.630 --> 00:56:30.000
From now on, follow my orders and go find Element X.

00:56:30.510 --> 00:56:34.290
Go to the tunnel.

00:57:02.810 --> 00:57:06.500
