01:02:23.710 --> 01:02:27.130
What are you up to? Is Kong here too?

01:02:27.330 --> 01:02:30.000
He's always in that cage.

01:02:31.950 --> 01:02:35.460
- What do you think of this robot? - It's called Mechanicong.

01:02:35.870 --> 01:02:39.970
- Is it good? - What are you up to, Dr. Fu?

01:02:40.370 --> 01:02:47.060
You're trying to make the real Kong do something impossible with a robot.

01:02:47.160 --> 01:02:49.740
- Am I right? - We're going to dig Element X.

01:02:49.980 --> 01:02:54.460
- Element X? - There's a lot to conquer the world.

01:02:54.820 --> 01:02:59.540
Otherwise, who would build a laboratory like this?

01:03:00.030 --> 01:03:05.690
It's not a robot. The original KONG is not saying anything. That's where I brought you.

01:03:05.690 --> 01:03:07.100
Yes, KAL.

01:03:07.100 --> 01:03:09.500
Do you think you're saying it?

01:03:09.500 --> 01:03:14.430
I know you're saying you're saying you're saying. What's your sister?

01:03:14.430 --> 01:03:15.890
I'm saying you're saying you're saying.

01:03:15.890 --> 01:03:17.820
I'm saying you're saying.

01:03:17.820 --> 01:03:22.620
Now, let's go.

01:03:22.620 --> 01:03:23.110
Hey!

01:03:53.000 --> 01:03:55.780
It's a big lab. They even made a room like this.

01:03:56.860 --> 01:03:59.320
That's the doctor's secret.

01:04:00.030 --> 01:04:05.220
- But there's no color TV. - It's fun to be able to tell a joke.

01:04:05.220 --> 01:04:15.160
- I'm really scared. - Don't worry, Sousa.

01:04:15.160 --> 01:04:21.510
Dr. Fu won't do anything unusual until he gets Element X.

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:32.150
Nelson's the only one that shows up.

01:05:16.640 --> 01:05:27.520
Please, take it easy.

01:05:32.680 --> 01:05:36.350
- Do you want some sake? - Yes, thank you.

01:05:36.350 --> 01:06:00.000
- I'll have some too. - You and Dr. Fu's relationship...

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:04.960
Well, I guess I'm a business partner.

01:06:04.960 --> 01:06:20.740
Make it clear. Are you better than Doctor Who?

01:06:20.740 --> 01:06:22.850
The North Pole is a nice place to live.

01:06:22.850 --> 01:06:30.000
If you miss the city, you can go to New York, Tokyo, London, Paris.

01:06:31.280 --> 01:06:37.350
You can fly half a day to the big city of the world, right?

01:06:37.350 --> 01:06:40.500
If you're okay with it,

01:06:40.500 --> 01:06:45.740
you can leave this lab to me.

01:06:45.740 --> 01:06:53.260
What kind of country is it that makes young people do such a thing?

01:06:53.260 --> 01:06:55.210
Tell me.

01:06:55.210 --> 01:06:57.940
