01:07:00.000 --> 01:07:04.410
Not Japanese, not Chinese, not Thai, not veteran, not Vilma.

01:07:05.360 --> 01:07:24.520
None of those things. Take them away.

01:07:24.520 --> 01:07:30.000
I'm not saying this because I don't want to.

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:32.200
It's different from the guys I've dealt with so far.

01:07:34.130 --> 01:07:35.770
It's interesting to hear that.

01:07:35.890 --> 01:07:41.340
Oh, well, I think you should leave it to me.

01:07:42.340 --> 01:07:45.270
You can't torture me.

01:07:48.680 --> 01:07:50.680
I'm just going to rebel more and more.

01:07:51.120 --> 01:07:52.720
It's not a normal torture.

01:07:52.880 --> 01:07:54.200
What are you going to do?

01:07:57.660 --> 01:07:58.900
I'm going to take time.

01:08:00.000 --> 01:08:06.010
I'll stop the room in the room. It's 30 degrees and it's a bit of a bit of a bit.

01:08:06.010 --> 01:08:14.310
No, that's not. If you're a boss, you'll be able to do something. You'll always do something.

