01:09:58.310 --> 01:10:00.000
What do you think?

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:07.400
The corpse is more beautiful than the executioner's.

01:10:07.400 --> 01:10:12.820
Susan, cut this.

01:10:12.820 --> 01:10:16.710
Jiro, it's okay. This is warmer.

01:10:34.640 --> 01:10:40.950
If you are in that, two young people will drink a warm coffee right now.

01:10:40.950 --> 01:10:50.380
The two of us will be the two of us than me, the king.

01:10:50.380 --> 01:10:54.130
I'm soon as the concrete wall is going to be like a wind.

01:11:14.400 --> 01:11:21.000
I can't even die here.

01:11:21.000 --> 01:11:27.270
Nelson is not good enough, so I'll die.

01:11:27.270 --> 01:11:30.000
You came here.

01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:30.930
What did you do?

01:11:31.030 --> 01:11:32.760
