01:11:34.610 --> 01:11:38.320
After work, I'll send you wherever you like, whether it's India or South America.

01:11:38.790 --> 01:11:40.440
Prepare tickets and money.

01:11:44.730 --> 01:11:49.460
If you don't take your life, you'll end up in jail.

01:11:52.250 --> 01:11:53.400
Hey, you!

01:11:54.430 --> 01:11:55.510
Get out of here!

01:12:08.160 --> 01:12:18.280
I feel like I'm on a mountain.

01:12:18.480 --> 01:12:21.790
Do you want to save that man?

01:12:21.990 --> 01:12:30.000
Yes, I do. I'll do it this time.

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:33.000
Now, let's put this beautiful face on the ice wall.

01:12:34.880 --> 01:12:37.330
It will be an unattractive face for him.

01:13:02.680 --> 01:13:08.230
Kaguya, don't do that!

01:14:05.240 --> 01:14:08.230
We're going to capture King Kong!

01:14:08.340 --> 01:14:10.370
- Take cover! - Yes, sir!

01:14:38.990 --> 01:14:40.940
