01:14:41.040 --> 01:14:42.760
Dr. Fu said you were dead.

01:14:42.860 --> 01:14:48.920
- We'll talk later. Let's get out of here. - Please.

01:15:36.620 --> 01:15:40.680
Uchida, you can't do this anymore.

01:15:40.680 --> 01:15:48.760
There's no poison in it, so it looks like we're going to lose.

01:15:48.760 --> 01:15:51.510
Let's forget about Element X for a while and have fun.

01:16:02.810 --> 01:16:04.450
Can Kongo swim far away?

01:16:04.450 --> 01:16:08.230
He can't swim. He's like a dolphin.

01:16:08.230 --> 01:16:12.290
He can swim from the island to the island.

01:16:12.290 --> 01:16:16.930
Don't you know it's all over?

01:16:16.930 --> 01:16:19.560
Get out of here.

01:16:19.560 --> 01:16:21.940
You get ready to go out.

01:16:21.940 --> 01:16:23.620
I'll be right after you.

01:16:23.620 --> 01:16:26.580
It's no use now.

01:16:26.580 --> 01:16:28.900
There's still a chance.

01:16:28.900 --> 01:16:30.000
I found Kongo.

01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:32.000
This girl will do as I say.

01:16:32.000 --> 01:16:33.680
Take her away!

01:17:05.880 --> 01:17:10.700
King Kongo has landed in Tokyo. It's not true for the radio.

01:17:10.700 --> 01:17:15.730
No, I can't give this ship to Tokyo.

01:17:15.730 --> 01:17:18.180
It's not a chance to catch Kongo.

01:17:18.180 --> 01:17:21.140
If it's on the island, the Mekani Kongo will win.

01:17:21.140 --> 01:17:24.590
Even if the robot is broken, it doesn't hurt.

01:17:24.590 --> 01:17:27.300
I'm not worried about winning.

01:17:27.300 --> 01:17:29.920
Even if I succeed, I can't believe it.

01:17:30.160 --> 01:17:32.210
I'll tell you why.

01:17:32.210 --> 01:17:38.360
If you were in Tokyo, there might be a few thousand, a few million of people in Tokyo.

01:17:38.360 --> 01:17:45.770
Oh, how long have you been thinking about that?

01:17:45.770 --> 01:17:53.720
If you put the Element X, there are a few million or a few thousand, or a few million people in the world.

01:17:53.720 --> 01:17:59.410
I'm worried about this, because our plans will be coming to the light of our lives.

01:18:00.510 --> 01:18:04.000
- Well, well... - There's no point in talking about this.

01:18:04.000 --> 01:18:13.130
The Mokka King Kong is entering the capital from the Hatsuba direction.

01:18:13.130 --> 01:18:18.050
All passengers on the runway, please return to the ground according to the order of the train.

01:18:18.050 --> 01:18:20.000
Please return to the ground.

01:19:05.050 --> 01:19:22.740
You'll be swimming, right?

01:19:22.740 --> 01:19:25.090
Why are you trying to save me?

01:19:25.090 --> 01:19:30.000
It's my job now.

01:19:30.000 --> 01:19:33.200
It was a failure, but it's over.

01:19:36.530 --> 01:19:39.830
Something happened to Doctor Who, isn't it?

01:19:39.890 --> 01:19:41.930
Don't ask anything.

01:19:42.030 --> 01:19:45.930
Once we land, please take King Kong out of Tokyo.

01:19:46.030 --> 01:19:49.590
It would be a big deal if it collided with Mechani-Kong.

01:19:49.690 --> 01:19:51.900
You're coming with us, aren't you?

01:19:52.490 --> 01:19:58.310
No, I'm not going.

01:19:58.410 --> 01:19:59.480
What are you going to do here?

01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:03.000
I don't care what you think of me.

01:20:03.000 --> 01:20:04.850
There's a submarine in the next room.

01:20:04.850 --> 01:20:14.880
Wait, I can't abandon you like this.

01:20:14.880 --> 01:20:19.370
I'm a secret agent of a country.

01:20:19.370 --> 01:20:26.190
I'll take responsibility for you.

01:20:26.190 --> 01:20:28.390
I don't want to know the name of my country.

01:20:32.080 --> 01:20:36.020
I don't want to be proud of what I've been doing.

01:20:36.020 --> 01:20:42.380
But I've been working for my own.

01:20:42.380 --> 01:20:45.720
I'm so proud of that.

01:21:11.870 --> 01:21:12.520
That's good.

01:21:30.800 --> 01:21:31.740
Let's go!

01:21:31.740 --> 01:21:33.800
Are you crazy?

01:21:33.800 --> 01:21:36.340
If you cause trouble here, this ship will be caught!

01:21:36.340 --> 01:21:37.590
It's a doctor's order!

01:21:37.590 --> 01:21:39.090
Oh!

01:22:55.020 --> 01:23:00.000
Please stop the train. It will be a big deal if you delay the train.

01:23:00.120 --> 01:23:03.810
- Who are you? - I'm not wearing a uniform.

01:23:04.080 --> 01:23:07.820
I'm Carl Nelson, Commander of the Explore Army.

01:23:07.880 --> 01:23:13.030
